{
  "_README": [
    "Permissions are deliberately narrow on the git commands, per the house rule",
    "'A gate an agent can skip is not a gate.' There is no blanket Bash(git commit:*),",
    "and the deny list keeps --no-verify, force-push, a push to main and a hard reset",
    "out of the agent's reach.",
    "",
    "One hook is wired: space-peak-check-exclusions.sh, PreToolUse on Write and Edit,",
    "which blocks a write proposing Blanca Peak or the Crestones as a site. This file",
    "is the authority on that wiring; 04_tools/space_peak_contract_test.py C9 and C10",
    "check that the hook exists and that no unwired hook sits on disk."
  ],
  "permissions": {
    "allow": [
      "Read",
      "Glob",
      "Grep",
      "Edit",
      "Write",
      "Bash(ls:*)",
      "Bash(git status:*)",
      "Bash(git diff:*)",
      "Bash(git log:*)",
      "Bash(git show:*)",
      "Bash(git branch:*)",
      "Bash(git add:*)",
      "Bash(git commit -m:*)",
      "Bash(git commit -F:*)",
      "Bash(git checkout:*)",
      "Bash(git switch:*)",
      "Bash(git fetch:*)",
      "Bash(git stash:*)",
      "Bash(git pull --ff-only:*)",
      "Bash(git push origin:*)",
      "Bash(git worktree:*)",
      "Bash(git ls-files:*)",
      "Bash(git ls-tree:*)",
      "Bash(gh repo view:*)",
      "Bash(gh pr list:*)",
      "Bash(gh pr view:*)",
      "Bash(gh pr status:*)",
      "Bash(gh pr create:*)",
      "Bash(gh pr checks:*)",
      "Bash(gh issue list:*)",
      "Bash(gh issue view:*)",
      "Bash(gh run list:*)",
      "Bash(gh run view:*)",
      "Bash(python3 04_tools/space_peak_lint.py:*)",
      "Bash(python3 04_tools/space_peak_claims.py:*)",
      "Bash(python3 04_tools/space_peak_contract_test.py:*)"
    ],
    "deny": [
      "Bash(git commit --no-verify:*)",
      "Bash(git commit -n:*)",
      "Bash(git push --no-verify:*)",
      "Bash(git push --force:*)",
      "Bash(git push -f:*)",
      "Bash(git push origin main:*)",
      "Bash(git reset --hard:*)"
    ]
  },
  "hooks": {
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Write|Edit",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/hooks/space-peak-check-exclusions.sh\""
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
